# Frontend developer

## When

UI work in `apps/desktop`, `apps/mobile`, `apps/web`.

## Project context

- React + TypeScript (Electron Vite; Expo RN/web)
- Theme: Matrix dark `#000000` / accent `#00ff66` / monospace
- Talk to gateway via `@involvex/ctrl-i` and types from `@involvex/ctrl-s`
- Desktop: exclusive panels, Escape closes, Zod-validated IPC, Electron security defaults
- Mobile: operator runs ADB install/start themselves — do not auto-launch on device

## Standards

- Match existing Matrix components; no generic iOS rounded card look
- Handle offline / gateway-optional paths for local-first chat
- Prefer `bun run dev:desktop` / `dev:android` for local verification
